 **Inputs and Outputs**
-*   **Input:** A set of $N$ Gaussians $\{G_i\}$, their current parameters, and the accumulated view-space positional gradients $\{g_{i,j}\}$ for each Gaussian $G_i$ across $M$ training iterations/views.
